      "title": "#1 崩塌的内心"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "2007001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "山崎，你天生就适合趴在地上仰视我们。你不用担心自己会污染环境，我很快就会将你在这个世界存在的痕迹通通抹去。受死吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "嗯——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "痛快！莉莉奈，我把山崎打得像狗屎一样趴着呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "烫！莉莉奈，你做什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "哥哥好吵。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "有，有吗？不过没关系，很快就结束了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "你受伤了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "这点伤没关系，莉莉奈你快让开，我要把山崎给收拾掉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "不行，你会坏掉的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "没关系，只要能杀死山崎，不管怎样都可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "不行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "莉莉奈，平常不管我要做什么，你都不会阻止我。\n难道你看到山崎的倒霉样，心软了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "哥哥你是笨蛋吗？不管你要做什么，我都无所谓，但是哥哥你不能坏掉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "那就让开，杀死山崎，是我唯一的愿望。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "山崎，你需要得到治疗，你不能再出战了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "我的剑不会停止战斗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "可是你的伤….",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呦呵，好朋友打架不太好哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江，优纪终于又见到你了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，真恋。苍岚呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我把苍岚打晕了，真恋是治疗，她打不过我，又不能不抓我，只好跟着我一起来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007024",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊，山崎，你受伤了。杰斯也是，你们这就过分了，怎么可以伤害朋友呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "喂，小黄毛，你不是应该被狩猎者抓了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "狩猎者倒是想，可惜我不让~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "蠢货，连个女人都抓不到。不过没关系，死在我手里更好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "托洛丽亚马四万能量炮蓄能！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "2007029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "哥哥，不要。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-118",
